{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 多智能体系统MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统的任务分解与分配策略\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/多智能体\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"多智能体系统的任务分解与分配策略\" dir=\"auto\">多智能体系统的任务分解与分配策略</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明多智能体系统中任务分解和分配的策略，包括常见的分解方法、分配算法，以及如何保证分解质量和分配效率。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>任务分解策略</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">任务分解是将复杂目标拆分为可独立执行的子任务的过程。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>1. 基于LLM的分解（最常用）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># LLM任务分解示例</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">decompose_task</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n    请将以下复杂目标分解为5-10个可独立执行的子任务。\n    每个子任务应该：\n    1. 有明确的输入和输出\n    2. 可独立执行\n    3. 有明确的完成标准\n\n    目标：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n\n    以JSON格式输出：\n    [{{\"name\": \"子任务名称\", \"description\": \"详细描述\",\n       \"dependencies\": [\"依赖的其他任务名\"], \"estimated_effort\": \"small/medium/large\"}}]\n    \"\"\"</span></span>\n    response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 分解方法对比</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分解方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>层次分解</strong></td>\n<td>自顶向下逐层分解</td>\n<td>结构清晰、易于理解</td>\n<td>可能过度分解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>功能分解</strong></td>\n<td>按功能模块拆分</td>\n<td>职责明确、便于分工</td>\n<td>可能忽略跨模块依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>数据分解</strong></td>\n<td>按数据域拆分</td>\n<td>数据一致性易保证</td>\n<td>跨数据域协作复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>混合分解</strong></td>\n<td>多种方法结合</td>\n<td>灵活适应复杂场景</td>\n<td>设计复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>任务分配策略</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>1. 静态分配（预分配）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 基于角色匹配的静态分配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">StaticAssignment</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">assign</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 根据Agent角色和任务需求匹配</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> agent <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>required_role <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>role<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> agent\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 无匹配时分配给默认Agent</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 动态分配（运行时分配）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 基于负载的动态分配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">DynamicAssignment</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">assign</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 选择当前负载最低的Agent</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">min</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_load<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 基于能力的动态分配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">CapabilityBasedAssignment</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">assign</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 评估每个Agent完成任务的能力得分</span>\n        scores <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_capability_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> agent <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> agents\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>scores<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>3. 拍卖机制分配（市场机制）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 基于合同网协议（Contract Net Protocol）的分配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ContractNetAssignment</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">assign</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. Manager广播任务</span>\n        bids <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> agent <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 每个Agent评估自己的能力并出价</span>\n            bid <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate_and_bid<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            bids<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>bid<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 选择出价最优的Agent</span>\n        winner <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_select_winner<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>bids<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> winner\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>保证分解质量的策略：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>依赖分析</strong>：明确子任务间的依赖关系，避免循环依赖</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>粒度控制</strong>：子任务不宜过大（失去并行优势）或过小（协调开销过高）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>验收标准</strong>：每个子任务有明确的完成标准</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>验证机制</strong>：分解结果由专门Agent验证合理性</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：完整的任务分解与分配系统</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Dict\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> dataclasses <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> dataclass<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> field\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@dataclass</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Task</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    description<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    dependencies<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> field<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>default_factory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    assigned_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n    status<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"pending\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># pending/running/completed/failed</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@dataclass</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">AgentProfile</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    role<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    capabilities<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    current_load<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">TaskOrchestrator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"任务编排器：负责分解和分配\"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">decompose</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"LLM驱动的任务分解\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n        将目标分解为子任务列表（JSON格式）：\n        目标：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        \"\"\"</span></span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        task_dicts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> task_dicts<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">assign</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>AgentProfile<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基于能力的任务分配\"\"\"</span>\n        assignment <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> task <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 找到能力最匹配的Agent</span>\n            best_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_match_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>assigned_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> best_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name\n            best_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_load <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\n            assignment<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> best_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> assignment\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_match_score</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> AgentProfile<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"计算Agent与任务的匹配度\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 基于角色匹配度和当前负载计算</span>\n        role_match <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.0</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>startswith<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>role<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.5</span>\n        load_factor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.0</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_load<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> role_match <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> load_factor\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 使用示例</span>\norchestrator <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> TaskOrchestrator<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\ntasks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> orchestrator<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>decompose<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"开发一个AI客服系统\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nagents <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n    AgentProfile<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"dev1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"前端开发\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"React\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"UI设计\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    AgentProfile<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"dev2\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"后端开发\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"API设计\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"数据库\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    AgentProfile<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"qa1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"测试工程师\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"自动化测试\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"性能测试\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\nassignment <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> orchestrator<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>assign<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：如何处理子任务之间的依赖关系？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：构建依赖图（DAG），使用拓扑排序确定执行顺序；对于可以并行的无依赖任务，同时分配执行；对于循环依赖，需要重新分解或合并任务。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：任务分配中的负载均衡如何实现？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：实时监控每个Agent的负载（进行中任务数、Token消耗、执行时间）；新任务优先分配给负载低的Agent；设置负载上限，超过后触发扩容或任务队列。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：任务分解越细越好。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：过度分解会增加协调开销和通信成本。每个子任务应该足够大以独立完成有价值的工作，同时足够小以便Agent高效执行。通常5-10个子任务为宜。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}